## 📊 データフロー図

### ログイン成功時のデータフロー

```
1. ユーザー入力
   group_id: "group001"
   user_id: "user001"
   password: "password123"

2. POST /api/auth/login/
   {
     "group_id": "group001",
     "user_id": "user001",
     "password": "password123"
   }

3. GroupUserAuthBackend.authenticate()
   ↓
   User.objects.filter(user_id="user001").first()
   → user = MUser(user_id="user001", password="pbkdf2_sha256$...", ...)
   ↓
   user.check_password("password123")
   → True
   ↓
   MUserGroup.objects.filter(
       user_id="user001",
       group_id="group001",
       is_active=True
   ).exists()
   → True
   ↓
   return user

4. login(request, user)
   ↓
   セッションID生成: "abc123xyz..."
   ↓
   django_session テーブルに保存:
   {
     "session_key": "abc123xyz...",
     "session_data": "user_id:user001, current_group_id:group001",
     "expire_date": "2025-12-15 12:00:00"
   }
   ↓
   Set-Cookie: sessionid=abc123xyz...; HttpOnly; SameSite=Lax

5. UserSerializer
   ↓
   {
     "user_id": "user001",
     "username": "山田太郎",
     "is_admin": false,
     "current_group": {
       "group_id": "group001",
       "group_name": "営業部"
     }
   }

6. フロントエンド
   ↓
   authStore.user = { user_id: "user001", ... }
   authStore.currentGroupId = "group001"
   ↓
   localStorage保存（pinia-plugin-persistedstate）
   ↓
   router.push("/") → HOME画面
```

